{"html":"<p>A program that runs every line once, top to bottom, can&#39;t do much. Control flow lets it choose between paths and repeat work. Java has the classic <code>if</code> and loops, plus a modern <code>switch</code> that&#39;s much safer than the old one.</p>\n<h2 id=\"if-and-else\">if and else</h2>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> score</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 72</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (score </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">} </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">else</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (score </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 70</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// this runs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">} </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">else</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The conditions are checked in order, and only the first true one runs. Always use braces, even for one line: it prevents bugs when someone adds a second line later.</p>\n<h3 id=\"the-ternary-operator\">The Ternary Operator</h3>\n<p>For a choice between two values, <code>condition ? a : b</code> is shorter:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"fail\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Keep it for simple cases. Nested ternaries are hard to read.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-switch-expression\">The switch Expression</h2>\n<p>Since Java 14, <code>switch</code> can return a value, with arrows instead of <code>case … break</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> Day</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">MONDAY</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">TUESDAY</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">SATURDAY</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">SUNDAY</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> kind</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> switch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (day) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> SATURDAY, SUNDAY </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"weekend\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> MONDAY, TUESDAY </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"weekday\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">};</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Why it&#39;s better than the old <code>switch</code> statement:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No fall-through:</strong> arrow cases never run into the next one, so there&#39;s no forgotten <code>break</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Exhaustive:</strong> the compiler checks that every value is covered. Add a <code>WEDNESDAY</code> to the enum and this code stops compiling until you handle it.</li>\n<li><strong>It&#39;s an expression:</strong> it returns a value you can assign.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When a case needs several lines, use a block and <code>yield</code> the value:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> fee</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> switch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (day) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> SATURDAY </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> base</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">        yield</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">*</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">};</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h3 id=\"pattern-matching-in-switch\">Pattern Matching in switch</h3>\n<p>Since Java 21, <code>switch</code> can test the <strong>type</strong> of a value, and <code>when</code> adds a condition:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> described</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> switch</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> Integer i when i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">></span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"big number\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> Integer i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"number \"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> i;      </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// this matches</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> String s </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"text \"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"something else\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">};</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Cases are tried in order, so put the more specific ones (with <code>when</code>) first.</p>\n<h2 id=\"loops\">Loops</h2>\n<h3 id=\"for\">for</h3>\n<p>When you know how many times to repeat:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">++</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \" \"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 0 1 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The three parts are: start, condition checked before each round, and the step after each round.</p>\n<h3 id=\"for-each\">for-each</h3>\n<p>To go through every item of an array or collection, use for-each. It&#39;s shorter and can&#39;t go out of bounds:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ana\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ben\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Chloé\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> names) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(name </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \" \"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Prefer it whenever you don&#39;t need the index.</p>\n<h3 id=\"while\">while</h3>\n<p>When you don&#39;t know how many rounds you need, loop while a condition holds:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">while</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(n);   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 128</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Make sure something in the loop moves toward the end, or it never stops.</p>\n<h3 id=\"do-while\">do-while</h3>\n<p>Like <code>while</code>, but the body runs <strong>at least once</strong>, because the condition is checked after it:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> tries</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">do</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    tries</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">++</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">} </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">while</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (tries </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(tries);   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 1</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>It&#39;s useful for &quot;ask until the input is valid&quot;.</p>\n<h2 id=\"break-and-continue\">break and continue</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>continue</code> skips the rest of this round and moves to the next one.</li>\n<li><code>break</code> leaves the loop completely.</li>\n</ul>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">++</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">%</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// skip even numbers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">></span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">break</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">;           </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// stop after 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \" \"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 1 3 5 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Inside nested loops, a label like <code>outer:</code> before the outer loop lets <code>break outer;</code> leave both at once. Use it sparingly: a small method with <code>return</code> is often clearer.</p>\n<h2 id=\"choosing-the-right-tool\">Choosing the Right Tool</h2>\n<div data-table-scroll><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>You want to…</th>\n<th>Use</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Choose between a few conditions</td>\n<td><code>if</code> / <code>else if</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pick one of two values</td>\n<td><code>? :</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map a value or type to a result</td>\n<td><code>switch</code> expression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go through every item</td>\n<td>for-each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Count, or need the index</td>\n<td><code>for</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repeat until something happens</td>\n<td><code>while</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Run once, then repeat while needed</td>\n<td><code>do-while</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"the-answer-in-short\">The Answer in Short</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><code>if</code> / <code>else if</code> / <code>else</code> checks conditions in order and runs only the first true one; always use braces.</li>\n<li>The <code>switch</code> expression returns a value, never falls through, and must cover every case.</li>\n<li>Since Java 21, <code>switch</code> matches types, with <code>when</code> for extra conditions; specific cases first.</li>\n<li>Use for-each to go through collections, <code>for</code> when you need the index, <code>while</code> when the number of rounds is unknown.</li>\n<li><code>continue</code> skips a round, <code>break</code> leaves the loop.</li>\n</ol>\n"}